:: Sister Office Brian [micro_event event nobr] {"position":"2675,2900","size":"100,100"}
/* Inline micro event in the Stage 1 main room (micro event 29, "Her rounds" in Define Events): she keeps $brian
   company while he solders. He never looks at her and barely gets a sentence out, but he doesn't send her away. */
<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/office/brian.mp4" 400>>
<p>$brian.name's corner of the office is a nest of cables, anti-static bags and a mug of hot chocolate that has gone cold without anybody touching it. $sister.callName has pulled a chair up next to his, chin in her hand, and she's watching him work like it's a cooking show.</p>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
	{ who: $sister, text: "And what does that one do?" },
	{ who: $brian, text: "Voltage regulator." },
	{ text: "He says it to the board. She waits, and after a while he adds, just as quietly, that it keeps the voltage steady." },
	{ who: $sister, text: "Okay, that one I probably could have guessed from the name." },
	{ who: $brian, text: "Hm. Yeah. Most of them are like that." },
	{ text: "He hasn't looked at her once. His ears have gone bright red, and every so often he opens his mouth as if a second sentence is on its way, then closes it again and goes back to the solder." },
	{ who: $sister, text: "Can I try? The little iron thing?" },
	{ who: $brian, text: "Um. No, it's... ehh, it's really hot. Sorry. You can hold the tweezers." },
	{ text: "She holds the tweezers with enormous seriousness, as if he'd handed her a scalpel." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<p>She stays for another twenty minutes and does most of the talking. When she finally gets up, $brian.name says 'bye' to the voltage regulator. After she's gone, he pushes his glasses up, looks at the empty chair for a moment and turns it a little, so it faces his desk again.</p>
<<UpdateStat "+" "Morale" 1>>
